*.raw
*.log
*.vcd
*.vvp
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# sim/ harness: per-corner ngspice logs under corners/ are committed evidence
# (append-only record trail), so they escape the *.log rule.
!sim/*/corners/**/*.log
# the run3 density stage's own deck log is committed evidence alongside its
# klt report (the report alone cannot carry a clean native-deck verdict,
# issue #404).
!layout/run3_top/drc_density_stage.log
# the run3 antenna stage's deck log escapes the same rule, and with the RDB
# committed beside it (not ignored) is the record of the per-finding measured
# ratios the klt report's envelope drops (issue #422).
!layout/run3_top/drc_antenna_stage.log
# (History only: runs adopting the artifact store do not use this exception;
# their raw outputs are staged below and only a manifest is committed.)
sim/.artifact-scratch/
sim/build/
# sim/ harness: generated per-corner ngspice decks are disposable, not
# evidence -- only the raw .log output above is committed.
**/.work/
# synthesis / P&R scratch
flow/build/
rtl/synth/.klt/
